## reading: started with --permission-mode bypassPermissions, the session ran in that mode; resumed by the bare line reopen printed, its next turn ran in auto mode, and a permission-mode line says auto. So a bare claude --resume doesn't keep bypassPermissions without --dangerously-skip-permissions or --allow-dangerously-skip-permissions (acceptEdits it keeps: claude-probe.log A).
